<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugo's JAT opens direct seasonal flights to Ohrid.</title>
<headline>Yugo's JAT opens direct seasonal flights to Ohrid.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yugoslav airlines Jugoslovenski Aerotransport (JAT) is opening regular seasonal flights to Ohrid in Macedonia from July 2 to October 5, the company said in a press release on Friday.</p>
<p>Two weekly flights are planned from Belgrade to Ohrid via the Macedonian capital Skopje, departing Sundays and Wednesdays.</p>
<p>Return flights from Ohrid will be on Thursdays via Skopje and Mondays direct to Belgrade, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Beti Bilandzic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 222 43 05</p>
</text>
